  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0400.kallisto.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0400.kallisto.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0400.kallisto.meineke1839-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0400_kallisto"><head>ΚΑΛΛΙΣΤΩ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0400-kallisto-1">
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0400-kallisto-1-l1">Κορίαννον εἰς τί λεπτόν; <speaker>Β.</speaker> ἵνα τοὺς δασύποδας</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0400-kallisto-1-l2">οὓς ἂν λάβωμεν ἁλσὶ διαπάττειν ἔχῃς.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus VIII p. 399 f: Ἀλκαῖος δ᾽ ἐν Καλλιστοῖ καὶ ὡς πολλῶν ὄντων (scil. leporum in Attica) ἐμφανίζει διὰ</note>
              <pb n="830" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.hxjhbd:scan:848" />
              <note type="apparatus">τούτων Κορίαννον κτλ. Vs. 1 vulgo κορίαννον εἶναί τι λεπτόν, ἵνα κτλ. Correxi ut supra edidi; quamquam possis etiam cum Bergkio κορίαννον ἵνα τί λεπτόν; — Vs. 2 libri ἐάν. Correxit Toupius. De coriandri usu in carnibus aestivo tempore servandis afferunt Plinium H. N. XX 20. 82.</note>
            </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" author_heading="ALCAEI" work_heading="ΚΑΛΛΙΣΤΩ" starts_on_page="830" ends_on_page="830" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0400-kallisto-2">
              <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 85 6. <quote>Βιβάζειν: τὸ ὀχεύειν. Ἀλκαῖος δ᾽ ἐν Καλλιστοῖ ἐπ᾽ ἀνθρώπους (leg. ἀνθρώπου) ἔφη.</quote>
              </note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>